  era: "Mesolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Mesolithic sites
  text: Important Mesolithic sites include Bagor in Rajasthan, Adamgarh and Bhimbetka in Madhya Pradesh, Langhnaj in Gujarat, Sarai Nahar Rai and Mahadaha in Uttar Pradesh, and Birbhanpur in West Bengal. Several have yielded burials and workshops for microliths.
